<section class="text-size-4">
  <h2 data-toc-exclude>Risks when genrating code with IA</h2>

  <h4>Data, secrets and source code exposure</h4>

  <p>Mitigate with</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Anonymize</strong> sensible data (private information,
      credentials) before prompting
    </li>
    <li>
      Verify your <strong>contract terms</strong>, "opt-out" to avoid the provider to use
      your data for its future training
    </li>
    <li>
      Use <strong>LLMs on premises</strong> (private instances)
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h4>Hallucinations</h4>
  <p>Mitigate with</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Human in the loop</strong></li>
    <li><strong>Prompt engineering</strong></li>
  </ul>

